{
  "comment": "Figma's shader presets ('By Figma'): the Fill picker's Shader fills (live popovers/fill-picker-custom.txt) and the Effects browser's Shader effects (live popovers/effects-add-shader-effects.txt), in the browsers' order. The names are live's; the keys, parameters, ranges and defaults are ours (unverified: live has no capture of a shader's settings). One source for the panels (src/shared/shaders/presets.ts) and the renderer (engine/tools/shaderpresets.mjs generates its table). A paint or effect stores the preset as customEffectId.assetRef.key and each parameter as a componentPropAssignment: defID {0, id}; numbers, choices (an option's index) as value.floatValue in the units shown, toggles as value.boolValue, colours as varValue (a COLOR literal). The shader reads colours in order from uniform slot 8, the other parameters in order from slot 14 (gfx/gl/Shaders.h kCustom*).",
